IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ccc-core`
IMPORT `ccc8-part8-murder`

-- ccc8-tests-part8-murder.l4 -- tests for ccc8-part8-murder.l4 (sections 229 to 240). Expected values are written by hand from the text.
-- The stand-in below is NOT the penalty of section 787(1) (outside this part): it states nothing, so only the limb of this part is tested.
`s 237 test fixture: a stand-in for the section 787(1) penalty` MEANS Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`

§ `Section 229 -- murder`

-- "Culpable homicide is murder (a) where the person who causes the death of a human being (i) means to cause his death, or (ii) means to cause him bodily harm that he knows is likely to cause his death, and is reckless whether death ensues or not; (b) where a person, meaning to cause death ... by accident or mistake causes death to another human being; or (c) if a person, for an unlawful object, does anything that they know is likely to cause death, and by doing so causes the death of a human being"
--                                              culpable     (a)(i) (a)(ii)harm reckless (b)  (c)
#ASSERT `s 229 culpable homicide is murder` (JUST TRUE)  TRUE  FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 229 culpable homicide is murder` (JUST TRUE)  FALSE TRUE  TRUE  FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 229 culpable homicide is murder` (JUST TRUE)  FALSE TRUE  FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 229 culpable homicide is murder` (JUST TRUE)  FALSE FALSE TRUE  FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 229 culpable homicide is murder` (JUST TRUE)  FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE  FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 229 culpable homicide is murder` (JUST TRUE)  FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE  EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 229 culpable homicide is murder` (JUST TRUE)  FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 229 culpable homicide is murder` (JUST FALSE) TRUE  FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 229 culpable homicide is murder` NOTHING      TRUE  FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 231 -- classification of murder`

-- (2) "Murder is first degree murder when it is planned and deliberate"
#ASSERT `s 231(2) the murder is first degree murder` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(2) the murder is first degree murder` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 231(2) the murder is first degree murder` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (3) "murder is planned and deliberate when it is committed pursuant to an arrangement under which money or anything of value passes ... as consideration for that other's causing or assisting in causing the death of anyone"
#ASSERT `s 231(3) the murder is planned and deliberate` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(3) the murder is planned and deliberate` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 231(3) the murder is planned and deliberate` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4) first degree murder "when the victim is (a) a police officer ... acting in the course of his duties; (b) a warden ... of a prison, acting in the course of his duties; or (c) a person working in a prison with the permission of the prison authorities and acting in the course of his work"
--                                                                    (a)   (b)   (c)   acting
#ASSERT `s 231(4) the murder is first degree murder because of the victim` TRUE  FALSE FALSE TRUE  EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(4) the murder is first degree murder because of the victim` FALSE TRUE  FALSE TRUE  EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(4) the murder is first degree murder because of the victim` FALSE FALSE TRUE  TRUE  EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(4) the murder is first degree murder because of the victim` TRUE  FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 231(4) the murder is first degree murder because of the victim` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE  EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (5) first degree murder when the death is caused while committing or attempting to commit an offence under section 76, 271, 272, 273, 279 or 279.1
#ASSERT `s 231(5) the murder is first degree murder because of the offence being committed` (`Provision of the Code` OF 76, "") TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(5) the murder is first degree murder because of the offence being committed` (`Provision of the Code` OF 271, "") TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(5) the murder is first degree murder because of the offence being committed` (`Provision of the Code` OF 272, "") TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(5) the murder is first degree murder because of the offence being committed` (`Provision of the Code` OF 273, "") TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(5) the murder is first degree murder because of the offence being committed` (`Provision of the Code` OF 279, "(1)") TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(5) the murder is first degree murder because of the offence being committed` (`Provision of the Code` OF 279.1, "") TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(5) the murder is first degree murder because of the offence being committed` (`Provision of the Code` OF 279.01, "") TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 231(5) the murder is first degree murder because of the offence being committed` (`Provision of the Code` OF 264, "") TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 231(5) the murder is first degree murder because of the offence being committed` (`Provision of the Code` OF 76, "") FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (5.1) first degree murder when the death is caused (a) while engaging in ... a pattern of coercive or controlling conduct ... in the case where the victim is that person's intimate partner; (b) ... control ... to exploit; (c) ... sexual; (d) ... hate
--                                                                              (a)   intimate        (b)   (c)   (d)
#ASSERT `s 231(5.1) the murder is first degree murder because of the circumstances` TRUE  (JUST TRUE)  FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(5.1) the murder is first degree murder because of the circumstances` TRUE  (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 231(5.1) the murder is first degree murder because of the circumstances` TRUE  NOTHING      FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 231(5.1) the murder is first degree murder because of the circumstances` FALSE (JUST TRUE)  TRUE  FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(5.1) the murder is first degree murder because of the circumstances` FALSE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE  FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(5.1) the murder is first degree murder because of the circumstances` FALSE (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE TRUE  EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(5.1) the murder is first degree murder because of the circumstances` FALSE (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (6) first degree murder when the death is caused while committing or attempting to commit an offence under section 264 (criminal harassment) with intent to cause the victim to believe that ... safety ... is threatened
#ASSERT `s 231(6) the murder is first degree murder because of criminal harassment` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(6) the murder is first degree murder because of criminal harassment` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 231(6) the murder is first degree murder because of criminal harassment` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (6.01) first degree murder when the death is caused while committing or attempting to commit an indictable offence ... if the act or omission constituting the offence also constitutes a terrorist activity
#ASSERT `s 231(6.01) the murder is first degree murder because of terrorist activity` TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(6.01) the murder is first degree murder because of terrorist activity` TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 231(6.01) the murder is first degree murder because of terrorist activity` TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 231(6.01) the murder is first degree murder because of terrorist activity` FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (6.1) first degree murder when (a) the death is caused ... for the benefit of ... a criminal organization; or (b) ... while committing or attempting to commit an indictable offence ... for the benefit of ... a criminal organization
#ASSERT `s 231(6.1) the murder is first degree murder because of a criminal organization` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(6.1) the murder is first degree murder because of a criminal organization` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(6.1) the murder is first degree murder because of a criminal organization` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 231(6.1) the murder is first degree murder because of a criminal organization` (JUST FALSE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 231(6.1) the murder is first degree murder because of a criminal organization` NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- (6.2) first degree murder when the death is caused while committing or attempting to commit an offence under section 423.1
#ASSERT `s 231(6.2) the murder is first degree murder because of intimidation` (`Provision of the Code` OF 423.1, "") TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(6.2) the murder is first degree murder because of intimidation` (`Provision of the Code` OF 423, "") TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 231(6.2) the murder is first degree murder because of intimidation` (`Provision of the Code` OF 423.1, "") FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (7) "All murder that is not first degree murder is second degree murder"
#ASSERT `s 231(7) the murder is second degree murder` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 231(7) the murder is second degree murder` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 231(7) the murder is second degree murder` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 231(7) the murder is second degree murder` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- (1) the kind of homicide offence: composed from sections 222, 229, 231, 232, 233 and 234
--                                                      culpable     murder (after 232(1)) infanticide  first degree routes
#ASSERT `s 231 the kind of homicide offence` (JUST TRUE)  (JUST TRUE)  (JUST FALSE) (LIST (JUST FALSE), (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS JUST `first degree murder`
#ASSERT `s 231 the kind of homicide offence` (JUST TRUE)  (JUST TRUE)  (JUST FALSE) (LIST (JUST FALSE), (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST `second degree murder`
#ASSERT `s 231 the kind of homicide offence` (JUST TRUE)  (JUST TRUE)  (JUST FALSE) (LIST (JUST FALSE), NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 231 the kind of homicide offence` (JUST TRUE)  (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) (LIST (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST manslaughter
#ASSERT `s 231 the kind of homicide offence` (JUST TRUE)  (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE)  (LIST (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS JUST infanticide
#ASSERT `s 231 the kind of homicide offence` (JUST TRUE)  NOTHING      (JUST FALSE) (LIST (JUST FALSE)) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 231 the kind of homicide offence` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE)  (JUST FALSE) (LIST (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 231 the kind of homicide offence` NOTHING      (JUST TRUE)  (JUST FALSE) (LIST (JUST TRUE)) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 232 -- murder reduced to manslaughter`

-- (2) "an indictable offence under this Act that is punishable by five or more years of imprisonment"
#ASSERT `s 232(2) the offence is punishable by five or more years of imprisonment` `imprisonment for life` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 232(2) the offence is punishable by five or more years of imprisonment` (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 5, 0, 0, FALSE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 232(2) the offence is punishable by five or more years of imprisonment` (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 5, 0, 0, TRUE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 232(2) the offence is punishable by five or more years of imprisonment` (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 6, 0, 0, TRUE)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 232(2) the offence is punishable by five or more years of imprisonment` (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 4, 11, 0, FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 232(2) the offence is punishable by five or more years of imprisonment` (`imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 2, 0, 0, FALSE)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 232(2) the offence is punishable by five or more years of imprisonment` `no imprisonment is stated` EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3) "no one shall be deemed to have given provocation to another by doing anything that he had a legal right to do, or by doing anything that the accused incited him to do in order to provide the accused with an excuse"
#ASSERT `s 232(3) the victim is deemed to have given provocation` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 232(3) the victim is deemed to have given provocation` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 232(3) the victim is deemed to have given provocation` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 232(3) the question is a question of fact` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 232(3) the question is a question of fact` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2) "Conduct of the victim that would constitute an indictable offence ... punishable by five or more years ... and that is of such a nature as to be sufficient to deprive an ordinary person of the power of self-control is provocation ..., if the accused acted on it on the sudden and before there was time for their passion to cool"
--                                                         indictable (5 yrs)      sufficient sudden cool  (3)
#ASSERT `s 232(2) the conduct of the victim is provocation` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 232(2) the conduct of the victim is provocation` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 232(2) the conduct of the victim is provocation` FALSE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 232(2) the conduct of the victim is provocation` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 232(2) the conduct of the victim is provocation` TRUE (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 232(2) the conduct of the victim is provocation` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 232(2) the conduct of the victim is provocation` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 232(2) the conduct of the victim is provocation` TRUE NOTHING TRUE TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- (1) "Culpable homicide that otherwise would be murder may be reduced to manslaughter if the person who committed it did so in the heat of passion caused by sudden provocation"
--                                                                          murder      heat  provocation
#ASSERT `s 232(1) the culpable homicide is reduced to manslaughter` (JUST TRUE)  TRUE  (JUST TRUE)  EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 232(1) the culpable homicide is reduced to manslaughter` (JUST TRUE)  FALSE (JUST TRUE)  EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 232(1) the culpable homicide is reduced to manslaughter` (JUST TRUE)  TRUE  (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 232(1) the culpable homicide is reduced to manslaughter` (JUST TRUE)  TRUE  NOTHING      EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 232(1) the culpable homicide is reduced to manslaughter` (JUST FALSE) TRUE  (JUST TRUE)  EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 232(1) the culpable homicide is reduced to manslaughter` NOTHING      TRUE  (JUST TRUE)  EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4) "Culpable homicide that otherwise would be murder is not necessarily manslaughter by reason only that it was committed by a person who was being arrested illegally, but the fact that the illegality of the arrest was known to the accused may be evidence of provocation"
#ASSERT `s 232(4) the homicide is manslaughter by reason only that the person was being arrested illegally` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 232(4) the homicide is manslaughter by reason only that the person was being arrested illegally` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 232(4) the homicide is manslaughter by reason only that the person was being arrested illegally` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 232(4) the knowledge of the illegality of the arrest may be evidence of provocation` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 232(4) the knowledge of the illegality of the arrest may be evidence of provocation` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 232(4) the knowledge of the illegality of the arrest may be evidence of provocation` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Sections 233 and 234 -- infanticide and manslaughter`

-- 233 "A female person commits infanticide when by a wilful act or omission she causes the death of her newly-born child, if at the time of the act or omission she is not fully recovered from the effects of giving birth to the child and by reason thereof or of the effect of lactation consequent on the birth of the child her mind is then disturbed"
--                                          female newly-born       not recovered disturbed
#ASSERT `s 233 the female person commits infanticide` TRUE (JUST TRUE)  TRUE  TRUE  EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a person who is not a female person: JUST FALSE, not NOTHING (fork F15: s 233 defines the category that s 231 and s 234 consume, and the offence, s 237, answers NOTHING for the same person)
#ASSERT `s 233 the female person commits infanticide` FALSE (JUST TRUE) TRUE  TRUE  EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 233 the female person commits infanticide` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE  TRUE  EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 233 the female person commits infanticide` TRUE (JUST TRUE)  FALSE TRUE  EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 233 the female person commits infanticide` TRUE (JUST TRUE)  TRUE  FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 233 the female person commits infanticide` TRUE NOTHING      TRUE  TRUE  EQUALS NOTHING
-- 234 "Culpable homicide that is not murder or infanticide is manslaughter"
#ASSERT `s 234 the culpable homicide is manslaughter` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 234 the culpable homicide is manslaughter` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 234 the culpable homicide is manslaughter` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 234 the culpable homicide is manslaughter` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 234 the culpable homicide is manslaughter` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Sections 235 to 238 -- punishment`

-- 235(1) "Every one who commits first degree murder or second degree murder is guilty of an indictable offence and shall be sentenced to imprisonment for life"; (2) "For the purposes of Part XXIII, the sentence of imprisonment for life prescribed by this section is a minimum punishment"
#ASSERT `s 235(1) the person commits the offence of first degree or second degree murder` (JUST `first degree murder`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 235(1) the person commits the offence of first degree or second degree murder` (JUST `second degree murder`) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 235(1) the person commits the offence of first degree or second degree murder` (JUST manslaughter) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 235(1) the person commits the offence of first degree or second degree murder` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 235(1) the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`
#ASSERT `s 235 the punishment` EQUALS LIST (Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for life`, `imprisonment for life`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`)
#ASSERT `s 235(2) the sentence of imprisonment for life is a minimum punishment` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 235(2) the sentence of imprisonment for life is a minimum punishment` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- 236(1) "Every person who commits manslaughter is guilty of an indictable offence and liable (a) where a firearm is used ..., to imprisonment for life and to a minimum punishment of imprisonment for a term of four years; and (b) in any other case, to imprisonment for life"
#ASSERT `s 236(1) the person commits the offence of manslaughter` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 236(1) the person commits the offence of manslaughter` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 236(1) the person commits the offence of manslaughter` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 236(1) the class of the offence` EQUALS `an indictable offence`
#ASSERT `s 236(1) the punishment` TRUE EQUALS LIST (Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for life`, `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 4, 0, 0, FALSE), `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`)
#ASSERT `s 236(1) the punishment` FALSE EQUALS LIST (Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for life`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`)
-- 236(2) "The court that imposes a sentence for manslaughter shall consider imposing a sentence of imprisonment for life if the person committed the manslaughter (a) ... intimate partner; (b) ...; (c) ...; or (d) ..."
--                                                                            (a)   intimate       (b)   (c)   (d)
